<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1894927508"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:22.909"><div begin="29.410" end="45.236" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.410" end="32.397" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.410" end="30.394">搬进一</span><span begin="30.394" end="31.408">座</span><span begin="31.408" end="31.732">鱼</span><span begin="31.732" end="32.397">缸</span></p><p begin="34.399" end="37.196" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.399" end="35.271">躲过一</span><span begin="35.271" end="36.216">场</span><span begin="36.216" end="36.604">风</span><span begin="36.604" end="37.196">浪</span></p><p begin="38.609" end="41.218" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.609" end="39.334">从此</span><span begin="39.334" end="40.133">悲</span><span begin="40.133" end="41.218">欢</span></p><p begin="42.057" end="45.236" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.057" end="43.809">不再与任何人</span><span begin="43.809" end="44.469">分</span><span begin="44.469" end="45.236">享</span></p></div><div begin="48.430" end="1:05.131" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.430" end="52.746" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.430" end="50.078">在这恒温天</span><span begin="50.078" end="50.959">地</span><span begin="50.959" end="51.346">间</span><span begin="51.346" end="51.876">游</span><span begin="51.876" end="52.746">荡</span></p><p begin="53.337" end="57.445" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.337" end="55.003">却仍贪恋着</span><span begin="55.003" end="55.549">你</span><span begin="55.862" end="56.280">的</span><span begin="56.280" end="56.760">目</span><span begin="56.760" end="57.445">光</span></p><p begin="58.186" end="1:00.848" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.186" end="59.874">心跳被争相</span><span begin="59.874" end="1:00.363">模</span><span begin="1:00.363" end="1:00.848">仿</span></p><p begin="1:01.058" end="1:05.131" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.058" end="1:02.358">凭直觉辨</span><span begin="1:02.358" end="1:02.886">认</span><span begin="1:03.251" end="1:03.572">你</span><span begin="1:03.572" end="1:04.203">模</span><span begin="1:04.203" end="1:05.131">样</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.334" end="1:26.567" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:08.334" end="1:14.623" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.334" end="1:11.135">我透过那层曲面玻璃</span><span begin="1:11.135" end="1:11.806">将</span><span begin="1:11.806" end="1:12.152">孤</span><span begin="1:12.152" end="1:12.674">单</span><span begin="1:12.674" end="1:13.462">投</span><span begin="1:13.462" end="1:14.623">影</span></p><p begin="1:18.125" end="1:26.567" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.125" end="1:20.991">若某天跃出水面只为</span><span begin="1:20.991" end="1:21.242">触</span><span begin="1:21.242" end="1:21.942">碰</span><span begin="1:21.942" end="1:22.342">你</span><span begin="1:22.807" end="1:23.064">的</span><span begin="1:23.064" end="1:26.567">心</span></p></div><div begin="1:27.608" end="1:47.122" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:27.608" end="1:32.106" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.608" end="1:29.150">最小的海是</span><span begin="1:29.150" end="1:29.882">否</span> <span begin="1:29.882" end="1:31.653">能容下我的悲</span><span begin="1:31.653" end="1:32.106">伤</span></p><p begin="1:32.344" end="1:37.140" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.344" end="1:33.193">我的梦</span><span begin="1:33.193" end="1:33.842">和</span><span begin="1:33.842" end="1:34.143">灵</span><span begin="1:34.143" end="1:35.081">魂</span><span begin="1:35.601" end="1:36.194">的</span><span begin="1:36.194" end="1:36.645">形</span><span begin="1:36.645" end="1:37.140">状</span></p><p begin="1:37.445" end="1:41.836" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.445" end="1:38.936">最爱的你是</span><span begin="1:38.936" end="1:39.642">否</span> <span begin="1:39.642" end="1:41.386">会渴望我的渴</span><span begin="1:41.386" end="1:41.836">望</span></p><p begin="1:41.996" end="1:47.122" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.99